{"key":"enterprise/T1564.006","id":"T1564.006","name":"Run Virtual Instance","domain":"enterprise","level":"subtechnique","parent_id":"T1564","tactics":["stealth"],"platforms":["ESXi","Linux","macOS","Windows"],"environments":["cloud-hosted-endpoint","onprem","virtualization"],"environment_basis":"project_taxonomy_from_upstream_platforms","summary":"Adversaries may carry out malicious operations using a virtual instance to avoid detection. A wide variety of virtualization technologies exist that allow for the emulation of a computer or computing environment. By running malicious code inside of a virtual instance, adversaries can hide artifacts associated with their behavior from security tools that are unable to monitor activity inside the virtual instance. Additionally, depending on the…","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1564/006","source_stix_id":"attack-pattern--b5327dd1-6bf9-4785-a199-25bcbd1f4a9d","source_modified":"2026-05-12T15:12:00.709Z","source_object_version":"2.0","telemetry":{"status":"mapped","components":[{"id":"DC0064","name":"Command Execution","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0064","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--685f917a-e95e-4ba0-ade1-c7d354dae6e0","page":"telemetry/DC0064/"},{"id":"DC0039","name":"File Creation","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0039","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--2b3bfe19-d59a-460d-93bb-2f546adc2d2c","page":"telemetry/DC0039/"},{"id":"DC0061","name":"File Modification","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0061","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--84572de3-9583-4c73-aabd-06ea88123dd8","page":"telemetry/DC0061/"},{"id":"DC0028","name":"Image Metadata","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0028","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--b597a220-6510-4397-b0d8-342cd2c58827","page":"telemetry/DC0028/"},{"id":"DC0032","name":"Process Creation","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0032","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--3d20385b-24ef-40e1-9f56-f39750379077","page":"telemetry/DC0032/"},{"id":"DC0060","name":"Service Creation","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0060","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--5297a638-1382-4f0c-8472-0d21830bf705","page":"telemetry/DC0060/"},{"id":"DC0063","name":"Windows Registry Key Modification","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0063","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--da85d358-741a-410d-9433-20d6269a6170","page":"telemetry/DC0063/"}],"strategies":[{"id":"DET0321","name":"Detection Strategy for Hidden Virtual Instance Execution","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0321","stix_id":"x-mitre-detection-strategy--55321f9d-1646-45b9-b23e-e3c0fe105400","relationship_id":"relationship--3ef5c5df-8e91-49c0-bdf8-e2d826c5e7b3"}],"analytics":[{"id":"AN0909","name":"Analytic 0909","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0321#AN0909","guidance":"Unusual execution of virtualization binaries (VBoxManage.exe, vmware-vmx.exe, vmwp.exe) with headless or suppressed notification arguments. Registry and service modifications linked to virtualization installs. Defender view: anomalies in process creation, service metadata, and registry writes tied to enabling hidden VMs.","platforms":["Windows"],"strategy_id":"DET0321"},{"id":"AN0910","name":"Analytic 0910","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0321#AN0910","guidance":"Execution of QEMU, KVM, or VirtualBox processes with unusual flags (e.g., '-nographic', '-snapshot'). File creation of VM images in atypical directories. Defender view: monitoring audit logs for process executions and file modifications linked to hidden virtualization.","platforms":["Linux"],"strategy_id":"DET0321"},{"id":"AN0911","name":"Analytic 0911","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0321#AN0911","guidance":"Execution of virtualization binaries (Parallels, VMware Fusion, VirtualBox) with arguments to hide UI. File monitoring for plist modifications indicating hidden virtualization behavior. Defender perspective: tracking process lineage and file modifications in system configs.","platforms":["macOS"],"strategy_id":"DET0321"},{"id":"AN0912","name":"Analytic 0912","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0321#AN0912","guidance":"Direct execution of /bin/vmx or presence of rogue .vmx files not registered in vCenter inventory. Defender perspective: anomalous commands in shell history, edits to rc.local.d/local.sh for persistence.","platforms":["ESXi"],"strategy_id":"DET0321"}],"log_sources":[{"component_id":"DC0032","component":"Process Creation","name":"WinEventLog:Sysmon","channel":"EventCode=1","platforms":["Windows"],"analytic_id":"AN0909","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0321#AN0909","validation":"upstream_definition_not_locally_validated","component_page":"telemetry/DC0032/"},{"component_id":"DC0060","component":"Service Creation","name":"WinEventLog:System","channel":"EventCode=7045","platforms":["Windows"],"analytic_id":"AN0909","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0321#AN0909","validation":"upstream_definition_not_locally_validated","component_page":"telemetry/DC0060/"},{"component_id":"DC0063","component":"Windows Registry Key Modification","name":"WinEventLog:Security","channel":"EventCode=4657","platforms":["Windows"],"analytic_id":"AN0909","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0321#AN0909","validation":"upstream_definition_not_locally_validated","component_page":"telemetry/DC0063/"},{"component_id":"DC0032","component":"Process Creation","name":"auditd:SYSCALL","channel":"execve calls for qemu-system*, kvm, or VBoxHeadless","platforms":["Linux"],"analytic_id":"AN0910","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0321#AN0910","validation":"upstream_definition_not_locally_validated","component_page":"telemetry/DC0032/"},{"component_id":"DC0039","component":"File Creation","name":"auditd:SYSCALL","channel":"File creations of *.qcow2, *.vdi,